    {
      "source": "Compute the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>prefix</code></a> for the actual cache key stored in Redis.",
      "translation": "计算实际存储在 Redis 中的缓存键的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>prefix</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
