      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a> scheme that prefixes cache keys with the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>prefix</code></a>. The\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>prefix</code></a> is prepended to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>cacheName</code></a> followed by double colons. For example, a prefix\nredis- with a cache named  myCache results in  redis-myCache::.",
      "translation": "创建一个<a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的接口\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a>方案，该方案使用给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>prefix</code></a>为缓存键添加前缀。\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>prefix</code></a>将被追加到<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>cacheName</code></a>之前，并在其后添加双冒号。例如，前缀为 redis-且缓存名为 myCache 时，结果为 redis-myCache::。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a> scheme that prefixes cache keys with the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>prefix</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个<a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的接口\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a>方案，该方案使用给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>prefix</code></a>作为前缀来修饰缓存键。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a default <a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a> scheme that prefixes cache keys with the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>name</code></a> of the cache\nfollowed by double colons.",
      "translation": "创建一个默认的<a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的接口\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a>方案，该方案使用缓存的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>name</code></a>作为前缀，后跟双冒号。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a default <a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a> scheme that prefixes cache keys with the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>name</code></a> of the cache\nfollowed by double colons. For example, a cache named myCache will prefix all cache keys with\nmyCache::.",
      "translation": "创建一个默认的<a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的接口\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a>方案，该方案使用缓存的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>name</code></a>作为前缀，后跟双冒号。例如，名为 myCache 的缓存会将所有缓存键以 myCache:: 作为前缀。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a> is a callback hook for creating custom prefixes prepended to the actual key stored\nin Redis.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的接口\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a> 是一个回调钩子，用于创建自定义前缀并将其附加到实际存储在 Redis 中的键之前。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>cacheName</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>name</code></a> of the cache in which the key is stored; will never be null.",
      "translation": "<code>cacheName</code> - 存储该键的缓存的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>name</code></a>；永远不会为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the computed <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>prefix</code></a> of the cache key stored in Redis; never null.",
      "translation": "计算出的缓存键中存储在 Redis 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>prefix</code></a>（java.lang 中的类或接口）；绝不 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>prefix</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>prefix</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This is a functional interface and can therefore be used as the assignment target for a lambda expression or method reference.",
      "translation": "这是一个函数式接口，因此可用作 Lambda 表达式或方法引用的赋值目标。",
      "count": 1
